Subject: [PATCH] Add DualSense Touchpad quick menu overlay (Resume, Return to Library, Exit)

Trigger the TrinityXSX Quick Menu on single-finger DualSense Touchpad click
(or L3+R3), render a native 1920x1080 overlay through VideoOut / libvulkan
idle flip, and allow Resume, Return to TrinityXSX Library, On-Screen Keyboard,
and Exit to PS5 Home from anywhere.

